  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UComCVPM | Maize Storage and Production Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Maize storage and marketing..Beneficiaries: 1835 (335 women)..Description: Construction of four 300-ton maize storage warehouses to promote grouped storage and sales. Access commercial credit to purchase members&apos; produce for resale. Provide assistance to better satisfy market requirements in term of quantity, quality and contract compliance.</narrative>
  </description>
